# Essential packages from the official archiso 'releng' profile that our
# curated lists must also include (our packages.x86_64 is generated only
# from packages/*.list, so anything only in releng would be lost here).
#
# - zsh + grml-zsh-config: root's shell on the live CD (pam_shells denies
#   every login without it, including the tty1 autologin).
# - systemd-resolvconf: resolvconf shim for dhcpdns client plumbing.
# - mtools / squashfs-tools: mkarchiso & rescue tooling.
# - reflector refreshes mirrorlists; wireless-regdb = wifi regulatory db.
zsh
grml-zsh-config
systemd-resolvconf
mtools
squashfs-tools
reflector
wireless-regdb
xdg-utils
kitty-terminfo
edk2-shell
sof-firmware

# Disk / install / rescue helpers (removed when the releng list was replaced)
parted
gptfdisk
partclone
testdisk
ntfsprogs
exfatprogs
xfsprogs
ddrescue

# Hypervisor guest agents (VirtualBox, QEMU, VMware, Hyper-V)
virtualbox-guest-utils-nox
qemu-guest-agent
open-vm-tools
hyperv
